            "content": "<p>For a contemporary or rustic feel, take a look at our extensive range of laminate flooring. It’s a great alternative to carpet in living and dining areas and with the latest modern styles and designs it can replicate the look of wooden planks to make it almost impossible to tell apart from the real thing. Shabby chic, or super sleek, we have every possible choice in stock.</p>\n<p>Three dimensional, embossed finishes, V-Groove and high definition will make your floor look amazing. Lay with underlay to dampen sound and add insulation and you’ll have a floor that’s comfortable, quiet and infinitely practical.</p>\n<p class=\"text6\">Products illustrated are subject to availability in selected stores, please call for details.</p>",
